comment.narrative:
The baseline and target for this indicator were not set.

The sub-indicators below represent the progress made towards reducing system interruptions at specific areas covered by the project:


 Average Interruption Frequency per year in&nbsp;Nampula - this sub-indicator was 89% achieved.&nbsp;
 Average Interruption Frequency per year in Tete - this sub-indicator was 91% achieved.&nbsp;


These&nbsp;results show significant progress towards the improvement in quality of service.
